{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/undokit\/firstundogroup"]}],"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"UndoKit"}],"title":"Your first Undo Group","roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Open a document, submit a typed edit, then Undo, Redo and reopen it.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Get-started","identifiers":["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/InstallingUndoKit","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/AppKitIntegration","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/UIKitIntegration","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/SwiftUIIntegration","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HostingYourModel"],"title":"Get started","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Run something first","anchor":"Run-something-first","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Clone the repository, select Xcode 27.1 (27A9275), and run an example from its root:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["ruby scripts\/run-durable-notes.rb --launch"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"sh"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Document A"}]},{"type":"text","text":", choose "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apply grouped example"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Its title becomes "},{"code":"Shopping","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and its body becomes "},{"code":"Tea and bread","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Undo restores both fields together; Redo"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restores both. Type into the body: native Undo\/Redo now walks the live typing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"history. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Commit typing"}]},{"type":"text","text":" settles that draft into a durable Undo Group."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are also "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Folio-Suite\/UndoKit\/tree\/main\/Examples\/DurableNotes\/UIKit","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Folio-Suite\/UndoKit\/tree\/main\/Examples\/DurableNotes\/SwiftUIApp","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Folio-Suite\/UndoKit\/tree\/main\/Examples\/DurableNotes\/SwiftUI","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"apps. Their READMEs give launch commands and interactive exercises."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Open one shared document session","anchor":"Open-one-shared-document-session","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following snippets use "},{"code":"NotesDocumentLease","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"NoteChange","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from the sample’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"DurableNotesCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" product. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Those are app-owned example types, not UndoKit API."}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The lease opens "},{"code":"Note.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", retains its writer lock, and registers a typed change"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handler. UndoKit owns the separate history database and draft journal."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistorySessions","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" collection in your app owner. Pass that same collection"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when opening documents, and keep the returned document owner outside transient"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"views. This small wrapper is shared by the three platform guides:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Foundation","import DurableNotesCore","import UndoKit","","@MainActor final class NoteDocument {","    let history: HistorySession","    let lease: NotesDocumentLease","    let changes: HistoryCommands<NoteChange>","","    private init(history: HistorySession, lease: NotesDocumentLease) throws {","        self.history = history","        self.lease = lease","        changes = try lease.commands(in: history)","    }","","    static func open(","        at directory: URL, mode: HistoryOpenMode, in sessions: HistorySessions","    ) async throws -> NoteDocument {","        let lease = NotesDocumentLease(directory: directory)","        let history = await sessions.open(","            documentURL: directory, mode: mode, lease: lease","        ) {","            try await lease.setup(mode: mode)","        }","        guard history.status.phase == .ready else {","            throw history.status.issue ?? HistoryFailure(","                .storage, stage: .admission, disposition: .suspended)","        }","        return try NoteDocument(history: history, lease: lease)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"code":".create","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" only for a deliberately new document, "},{"code":".existing","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when reopening a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"known one. Persist the document’s scope and working identity; never generate new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identities each launch to get around an opening failure. The sample stores them"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in its domain file. A partial or missing known document is an error, not a reason"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to create replacement history."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open this wrapper "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"once per document"}]},{"type":"text","text":", then share it between presentations."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The lease and operation declaration have stable identity while open. The complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sample registry also deduplicates requests for the same document and handles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"blocked acquisition; use that pattern for a multiwindow app. A blocked session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remains retained by the application collection so recovery can finish."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Localize durable native action names","anchor":"Localize-durable-native-action-names","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Operation metadata is opaque to UndoKit. The Durable Notes operation records the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"durable-notes.action","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" family and one of "},{"code":"title","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"note","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The host can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decode that payload and install a resolver on the main actor:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@MainActor","func installActionNames(on document: NoteDocument) {","    document.history.setNativeActionNameResolver { payload in","        guard payload.family == \"durable-notes.action\",","              let name = String(data: payload.data, encoding: .utf8)","        else { return nil }","        switch name {","        case \"title\":","            return NSLocalizedString(","                \"Change Title\",","                comment: \"Native action name, without Undo\/Redo prefix\")","        case \"body\":","            return NSLocalizedString(","                \"Edit Note Body\",","                comment: \"Native action name, without Undo\/Redo prefix\")","        case \"note\":","            return NSLocalizedString(","                \"Change Note\",","                comment: \"Native action name, without Undo\/Redo prefix\")","        default: return nil","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Missing metadata, an unknown key, a nil result or a thrown resolver error leaves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the native generic label in place. Install the resolver again after reopening and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after a language change so names reflect the current localization. Keep the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"synchronous resolver short, avoid session mutation, and capture host owners weakly."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Add translations for these source strings in your app’s own localization bundle;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without translations, the example still displays readable action names."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Focused live\/local typing keeps its own native names. Native Undo\/Redo starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asynchronous semantic work; use "},{"code":"waitForNativeOperations()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when the caller must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"observe its completion."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Submit application intent","anchor":"Submit-application-intent","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is a rename button’s action. Read the current title, filter a known no-op,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and submit a typed value. The example handler validates the expected title before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accepting it, so a stale read cannot overwrite a concurrent accepted edit."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@MainActor","func renameNote(_ document: NoteDocument, to title: String) async throws","    -> HistorySubmissionResult? {","    let oldTitle = try await document.lease.read().note.title","    guard oldTitle != title else { return nil }","    return await document.changes.submit(","        NoteChange(field: .title, expected: oldTitle, replacement: title))","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For title and body changes that must succeed together, call "},{"code":"submitGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"both values on the same typed handle. One host callback accepts the complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ordered group atomically. Your editing call sites do not assign transaction"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identities, encode payloads or take whole-document snapshots."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Result"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What your UI should do"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".accepted","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Show the accepted state; also check session readiness before enabling input."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".rejected","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Explain that validation declined the request; no semantic effect was accepted."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".unexecuted","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The request did not reach delivery. After resolving its cause, let the user submit fresh intent."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".failed","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A usable failure was established. Inspect the failure and current status."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".unresolved","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep recovery visible and editing blocked; reconcile the original request."}]}]]],"type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The helper returns "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for its local no-op; that request never enters UndoKit."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Undo, Redo and close","anchor":"Undo-Redo-and-close","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can await "},{"code":"document.history.undo()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"redo()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for application controls, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"supply a presentation attachment’s UndoManager to native menus and responders."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The platform guides show the latter. Native live typing and settled application"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"history share that route without persisting each keystroke."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"At the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"document"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ownership boundary, await "},{"code":"document.history.close()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and check"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that its phase is "},{"code":".closed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". A blocked close retains recovery ownership; do not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"release or replace the domain resources prematurely. Closing one window of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shared document only disconnects that window’s attachment."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reopen with "},{"code":".existing","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", read the host’s state and receipts, and check Undo\/Redo"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"availability. Reopening reconciles authoritative outcomes; it does not redeliver"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accepted changes. Recovered field drafts require a deliberate retry\/discard choice."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Next","anchor":"Next","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/AppKitIntegration","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/UIKitIntegration","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/SwiftUIIntegration","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HostingYourModel","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RecoveryAndStorage","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit"],["doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit","doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/InstallingUndoKit"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/FirstUndoGroup","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/HostingYourModel":{"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HostingYourModel","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/hostingyourmodel","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Replace the example’s domain host while keeping session and presentation wiring."}],"title":"Connect your own model"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/HistorySessions":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HistorySessions"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/HistorySessions","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/historysessions","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HistorySessions"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Retains the application’s open documents and their shared editing\/recovery owners.","type":"text"}],"title":"HistorySessions"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/RecoveryAndStorage":{"url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/recoveryandstorage","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/RecoveryAndStorage","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Recovery, storage and concurrency","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Preserve exact intent and authoritative evidence across uncertainty."}]},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/InstallingUndoKit":{"url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/installingundokit","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/InstallingUndoKit","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Installing UndoKit","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Select one dynamic runtime and resource owner per process."}]},"https://github.com/Folio-Suite/UndoKit/tree/main/Examples/DurableNotes/SwiftUIApp":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Folio-Suite\/UndoKit\/tree\/main\/Examples\/DurableNotes\/SwiftUIApp","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftUI Mac","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"SwiftUI Mac","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Folio-Suite\/UndoKit\/tree\/main\/Examples\/DurableNotes\/SwiftUIApp"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/undokit","title":"UndoKit","abstract":[{"text":"Durable Undo and Redo for Swift apps, with the native editing behavior people expect.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/SwiftUIIntegration":{"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/SwiftUIIntegration","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/swiftuiintegration","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Let SwiftUI compose the screen while a stable owner retains the editor, binding and session."}],"title":"Present native history in SwiftUI"},"https://github.com/Folio-Suite/UndoKit/tree/main/Examples/DurableNotes/SwiftUI":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Folio-Suite\/UndoKit\/tree\/main\/Examples\/DurableNotes\/SwiftUI","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftUI iPhone\/iPad","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"SwiftUI iPhone\/iPad","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Folio-Suite\/UndoKit\/tree\/main\/Examples\/DurableNotes\/SwiftUI"},"https://github.com/Folio-Suite/UndoKit/tree/main/Examples/DurableNotes/UIKit":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Folio-Suite\/UndoKit\/tree\/main\/Examples\/DurableNotes\/UIKit","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"UIKit","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"UIKit","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Folio-Suite\/UndoKit\/tree\/main\/Examples\/DurableNotes\/UIKit"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/AppKitIntegration":{"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/AppKitIntegration","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/appkitintegration","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Bind native text views to a document’s typed operations and route the window’s UndoManager."}],"title":"Add history to an AppKit window"},"doc://dev.foliosuite.UndoKit/documentation/UndoKit/UIKitIntegration":{"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/dev.foliosuite.UndoKit\/documentation\/UndoKit\/UIKitIntegration","url":"\/documentation\/undokit\/uikitintegration","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep a native text view and its history binding with the scene’s document presentation."}],"title":"Add history to a UIKit scene"}}}